#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetmcmc.md:1
msgid "`cnetmcmc`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetmcmc.md:3
msgid ""
"`cnetmcmc` builds phylogenetic trees from copy-number profiles using a "
"Bayesian MCMC approach."
msgstr "`cnetmcmc` 用贝叶斯 MCMC 方法从拷贝数谱构建系统发育树。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetmcmc.md:7
msgid ""
"This page is migrated from the top-level `README.md`, `run-cnetmcmc.sh`, and"
" `mcmc.cfg` (now `config/cnet_mcmc.cfg`). Please review for accuracy and "
"completeness."
msgstr ""
"本页内容迁移自顶层 `README.md`、`run-cnetmcmc.sh` 和 `mcmc.cfg`（现为 "
"`config/cnet_mcmc.cfg`），请核对其准确性和完整性。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetmcmc.md:12
msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetmcmc.md:14
msgid ""
"Under active development. Only the basic MCMC algorithm is implemented, and "
"it has not been comprehensively tested (per the original README) — the least"
" mature of the three tools. No workflow or architecture diagrams exist for "
"it yet; see [Workflows](../workflows/index.md)."
msgstr ""
"仍在开发中。据原 README，目前只实现了基本的 MCMC "
"算法，且未经全面测试，是三个工具中最不成熟的一个。它还没有工作流程图或架构图，见[工作流程](../workflows/index.md)。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetmcmc.md:19
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "用法"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetmcmc.md:25
msgid ""
"`bin/run-cnetmcmc.sh` runs multiple chains and reads most parameters from "
"`config/cnet_mcmc.cfg` via `--config_file`. Set `CNETA_CONFIG` to use a "
"different file; the script stops if the file does not exist."
msgstr ""
"`bin/run-cnetmcmc.sh` 运行多条链，大部分参数通过 `--config_file` 从 `config/cnet_mcmc.cfg`"
" 读取。设置 `CNETA_CONFIG` 可以换用其他文件；文件不存在时脚本会停止。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetmcmc.md:29
msgid "Modes"
msgstr "运行模式"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetmcmc.md:31
msgid ""
"Two starting-tree paths depending on whether a reference tree is supplied "
"(`--rtreefile`): with one, the starting tree is built from it; without one, "
"from `--init_tree`. Either way, whether the topology stays fixed during "
"sampling is controlled separately by `--fix_topology` — see the [MCMC "
"workflow](../workflows/index.md#mcmc-workflow-cnetmcmc) diagram for the full"
" picture (draft; traced from source, not yet reviewed)."
msgstr ""
"根据是否提供参考树（`--rtreefile`），起始树有两种来源：提供时由参考树构建，不提供时由 `--init_tree` "
"决定。无论哪种，采样过程中拓扑是否固定都由 `--fix_topology` 单独控制。完整流程见 [MCMC "
"工作流程](../workflows/index.md#mcmc-workflow-cnetmcmc)图（草稿，根据源码整理，尚未审核）。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetmcmc.md:39
msgid "Options"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetmcmc.md:41
msgid "`--rtreefile`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetmcmc.md:42
msgid ""
"Optional reference tree; used to build the starting tree (see \"Modes\" "
"above — it does not by itself fix the topology)."
msgstr "可选的参考树，用于构建起始树（见上文\"运行模式\"，它本身并不固定拓扑）。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetmcmc.md:45
msgid "`--init_tree`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetmcmc.md:46
msgid ""
"`0` random tree · `1` a provided tree (`--file_itree`) · `2` a random tree "
"sharing the real tree's topology."
msgstr "`0` 随机树 · `1` 提供的树（`--file_itree`） · `2` 与真实树拓扑相同的随机树。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetmcmc.md:49
msgid "`config/cnet_mcmc.cfg` (via `--config_file`)"
msgstr "`config/cnet_mcmc.cfg`（通过 `--config_file`）"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetmcmc.md:50
msgid ""
"MCMC control (`n_draws`, `n_burnin`, `n_gap`, `sample_prior`, "
"`fix_topology`); proposal/prior parameters for mutation rates (`sigma_l*` "
"for the log-normal prior, `sigma_*` for the proposal, per event type); tree-"
"height and branch-length priors (`sigma_height`, `tlen_shape`, `tlen_scale`,"
" `dirichlet_param`/`dirichlet_alpha`); and proposal step sizes (`lambda`, "
"`lambda_all`)."
msgstr ""
"MCMC 控制参数（`n_draws`、`n_burnin`、`n_gap`、`sample_prior`、`fix_topology`）；突变速率的 "
"proposal/先验参数（每种事件类型各有 `sigma_l*` 用于 lognormal 先验、`sigma_*` 用于 "
"proposal）；树高和枝长先验（`sigma_height`、`tlen_shape`、`tlen_scale`、`dirichlet_param`/`dirichlet_alpha`）；以及"
" proposal 步长（`lambda`、`lambda_all`）。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetmcmc.md:57
msgid "Inputs"
msgstr "输入"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetmcmc.md:59
msgid ""
"The same copy-number and sample-timing files as `cnetml` — see [File formats"
"](../file-formats/index.md)."
msgstr "与 `cnetml` 相同的拷贝数文件和样本时间文件，见[文件格式](../file-formats/index.md)。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetmcmc.md:62
msgid "Outputs"
msgstr "输出"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetmcmc.md:64
msgid ""
"MrBayes-compatible trace files, named via `--trace_param_file`/ "
"`--trace_tree_file` (C++ defaults: `trace-mcmc-params.txt` / `trace-mcmc-"
"trees.txt`; `run-cnetmcmc.sh` is what names them `*.p`/`*.t`):"
msgstr ""
"与 MrBayes 兼容的 trace 文件，文件名由 `--trace_param_file`/ `--trace_tree_file` 指定（C++"
" 默认值：`trace-mcmc-params.txt` / `trace-mcmc-trees.txt`；`*.p`/`*.t` 这两个名字是 "
"`run-cnetmcmc.sh` 起的）："

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetmcmc.md:68
msgid "`*.p`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetmcmc.md:69
msgid ""
"Parameter traces. Check convergence with "
"[Tracer](https://beast.community/tracer) or `util/check_convergence.R` (uses"
" [RWTY](https://github.com/danlwarren/RWTY))."
msgstr ""
"参数 trace。用 [Tracer](https://beast.community/tracer) 或 "
"`util/check_convergence.R`（基于 "
"[RWTY](https://github.com/danlwarren/RWTY)）检查收敛。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetmcmc.md:73
msgid "`*.t`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetmcmc.md:74
msgid ""
"Sampled trees. Summarise with "
"[TreeAnnotator](https://beast.community/treeannotator) into a maximum clade "
"credibility tree."
msgstr "采样得到的树。用 [TreeAnnotator](https://beast.community/treeannotator) 汇总成最大分支可信度树。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/cnetmcmc.md:78
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

